							OBSIDIAN FEAR is now at http://www.obsidianfear.com
Although the old link will still forward to the new domain, would you update your bookmarks to reflect the new change?
Thanks!
Selias Trailtracker (officer of Obsidian Fear)

							<br>
							 - Selias Trailtracker<BR><BR>
							</p>
